{"id":"n81001-1-10","stage":4,"title":"카페인 · 咖啡因","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81001-1-10-1","ko":"낮에 커피를 마시는 바람에 밤새 잠을 못 잤어요.","zh":"因为白天喝了咖啡，所以一整晚都睡不着。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"낮에","meaning":"白天，白日，日间","explanation":"낮：白天，白日，日间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"낮","audio":"/audio/cde379a91768ef6117a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64497","senseId":"1","lemma":"낮","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낮에","audio":"/audio/7fdfc5c3ffa68235ca32.mp3"}},{"text":"커피를","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"2","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커피를","audio":"/audio/5f07afae7adf3e91d8be.mp3"}},{"text":"마시는","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마시는","audio":"/audio/9ff74739492cf3d94148.mp3"}},{"text":"바람에","meaning":"表示后句的理由或原因。","explanation":"바람：表示后句的理由或原因。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58172","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바람에","audio":"/audio/2c70d627030132bf596e.mp3"}},{"text":"밤새","meaning":"整晚，整夜","explanation":"밤새：整晚，整夜","readings":[{"term":"밤새","audio":"/audio/5cc956034440dea88c75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15467","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밤새","audio":"/audio/5cc956034440dea88c75.mp3"}},{"text":"잠을","meaning":"觉，睡眠","explanation":"잠：觉，睡眠；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"잠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70078","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠을","audio":"/audio/76afcb272f116ce8b9ef.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"잤어요.","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잤어요","audio":"/audio/ade6406369e88b6c9bd9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"cde379a91768ef61","term":"낮","zh":"白天，白日，日间","audio":"/audio/cde379a91768ef6117a6.mp3","entryId":"64497","definition":"从天亮到天黑的一段时间。","pronunciation":["낟"]},{"id":"a4215a3126661d52","term":"커피","zh":"咖啡","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3","entryId":"27372","definition":"是一种用咖啡豆制作出来的、苦涩的深棕色饮品，其含有独特的香味及咖啡因。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]},{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"表示后句的理由或原因。","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"58172","definition":"表示后句的理由或原因。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"5cc956034440dea8","term":"밤새","zh":"整晚，整夜","audio":"/audio/5cc956034440dea88c75.mp3","entryId":"15467","definition":"从入夜到第二天早晨之间的时间段。","pronunciation":["밤쌔"]},{"id":"699e97260979403d","term":"잠","zh":"觉，睡眠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3","entryId":"70078","definition":"指闭上眼睛，停止身体、精神活动而休息一会儿的状态。","pronunciation":["잠"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ec06ccf7093dc41a6b77.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81001-1-10-2","ko":"카페인에 굉장히 약한가 보네요.","zh":"看来你对咖啡因非常敏感啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"카페인에","meaning":"咖啡因","explanation":"카페인：咖啡因；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"카페인","audio":"/audio/b65c1f5dca8161f553e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81001","senseId":"1","lemma":"카페인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"카페인에","audio":"/audio/50b302c6b52d2d667eec.mp3"}},{"text":"굉장히","meaning":"非常，惊人地","explanation":"굉장히：非常，惊人地","readings":[{"term":"굉장히","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30882","senseId":"2","lemma":"굉장히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"굉장히","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3"}},{"text":"약한가","meaning":"弱","explanation":"약하다：弱；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"약하다","audio":"/audio/26dfca7d15ecbdb7d4a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71619","senseId":"4","lemma":"약하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약한가","audio":"/audio/7f7bd6ebe154f90ef114.mp3"}},{"text":"보네요.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보네요","audio":"/audio/a6513b811204efa2ffc8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b65c1f5dca8161f5","term":"카페인","zh":"咖啡因","audio":"/audio/b65c1f5dca8161f553e6.mp3","entryId":"81001","definition":"富含在咖啡或茶叶中，使神经兴奋，过量食用则容易上瘾的无色苦味的固体。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5ffdea7285118469","term":"굉장히","zh":"非常，惊人地","audio":"/audio/5ffdea7285118469641b.mp3","entryId":"30882","definition":"很了不得地。","pronunciation":["굉장히","궹장히"]},{"